4. Co-Pilot text sizing improvements
5. EmailJS lead submission issue (opening new tab instead of using EmailJS)
6. Chatbot auto-scroll forcing users to scroll back up after clicking prompts
7. **NEW:** White-on-white text issue when hovering over Co-Pilot buttons

**Progress Status:**

